1
00:00:05,923 --> 00:00:07,173
-Who are you?
-Castiel.

2
00:00:07,341 --> 00:00:09,509
I'm an angel of the Lord.

3
00:00:09,718 --> 00:00:12,679
The symbol you saw is called
the rising of the witnesses.

4
00:00:12,846 --> 00:00:14,889
It figures into an ancient prophecy.

5
00:00:15,057 --> 00:00:17,600
-What book is that prophecy from?
-Revelations.

6
00:00:17,768 --> 00:00:19,811
This is a sign, boys.

7
00:00:19,978 --> 00:00:22,438
SAM: A sign of what?
-The Apocalypse.

8
00:00:22,606 --> 00:00:25,900
Those seals are
being broken by Lilith.

9
00:00:26,068 --> 00:00:28,236
I don't think l like you anymore.

10
00:00:28,779 --> 00:00:30,822
You think of the seals
as locks on a door.

11
00:00:30,989 --> 00:00:34,117
-Okay, last one opens and....
-Lucifer walks free.

12
00:00:34,284 --> 00:00:36,244
Tell me about the months
without brother.

13
00:00:36,412 --> 00:00:39,580
About all the things you and
this demon bitch do in the dark.

14
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:44,085
Do you even know how far off
the reservation you've gone?

15
00:00:44,253 --> 00:00:47,171
How far from normal, from human?

16
00:00:48,006 --> 00:00:51,426
Cas said that if l don't stop you, he will.

17
00:00:54,138 --> 00:00:56,389
CASTlEL: The raising of Samhain
is one of the 66 seals.

18
00:00:56,557 --> 00:01:00,184
Breaking of the seal must be
prevented at all costs.

19
00:01:02,062 --> 00:01:04,439
URIEL: You were told not
to use your abilities.

20
00:01:07,735 --> 00:01:10,903
-What was l supposed to do?
-The only reason you're still alive...

21
00:01:11,071 --> 00:01:12,822
...is because you've been useful.

22
00:01:12,990 --> 00:01:15,616
The second you become
more trouble than you're worth...

23
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:17,368
...then l will turn you to dust.

24
00:01:17,536 --> 00:01:19,328
As for your brother, tell him that...

25
00:01:19,496 --> 00:01:22,081
...maybe he should climb off
that high horse of his.

26
00:01:22,249 --> 00:01:25,543
Ask Dean what he remembers
from hell.

27
00:01:43,479 --> 00:01:45,062
WOMAN:
Anna?

28
00:01:45,773 --> 00:01:47,899
Do you know where you are?

29
00:01:49,568 --> 00:01:53,571
You're at the Connor Beverly
Behavioral Medicine Center.

30
00:01:53,864 --> 00:01:56,032
Do you know why you're here?

31
00:01:58,494 --> 00:02:00,953
Do you remember what you did?

32
00:02:02,915 --> 00:02:05,082
You were hysterical.

33
00:02:05,250 --> 00:02:08,628
It took four people to restrain you.

34
00:02:09,755 --> 00:02:12,548
I was trying to warn them.

35
00:02:13,258 --> 00:02:15,092
WOMAN:
Warn who?

36
00:02:15,469 --> 00:02:17,303
Everyone.

37
00:02:19,139 --> 00:02:20,348
Forget it.

38
00:02:20,974 --> 00:02:22,892
It was stupid.

39
00:02:24,353 --> 00:02:26,229
What were you trying
to warn them about?

40
00:02:30,317 --> 00:02:31,818
Look.

41
00:02:32,611 --> 00:02:35,279
I get it. You think I'm nuts.

42
00:02:36,990 --> 00:02:39,867
If l were you, I'd think I was nuts.

43
00:02:40,035 --> 00:02:42,703
But it's all true.

44
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:48,084
It's okay. You can tell me.
I'm here to listen.

45
00:02:51,046 --> 00:02:55,091
The end is coming.

46
00:02:56,260 --> 00:03:01,138
-The Apocalypse.
-The Apocalypse, like in the Bible?

47
00:03:02,808 --> 00:03:06,811
Kind of. I mean, same bottom line.

48
00:03:08,939 --> 00:03:13,234
This demon, Lilith, is trying
to break the 66 seals...

49
00:03:13,402 --> 00:03:19,699
...to free Lucifer from hell.
Lucifer will bring the Apocalypse.

50
00:03:22,619 --> 00:03:23,661
So...

51
00:03:24,496 --> 00:03:26,747
...smoke them if you got them.

52
00:03:38,051 --> 00:03:39,760
Anna?

53
00:03:42,514 --> 00:03:44,265
Sorry.

54
00:03:44,808 --> 00:03:48,019
-What were you doing?
-Nothing.

55
00:03:49,730 --> 00:03:51,981
Just listening.

56
00:03:52,149 --> 00:03:57,153
So you were saying that there are
66 of these seals in the world?

57
00:03:57,321 --> 00:04:02,116
No. No. There are about
600 possible seals.

58
00:04:02,284 --> 00:04:04,869
And Lilith only has
to break 66 of them...

59
00:04:05,037 --> 00:04:08,080
...and no one knows
which 66 she's gonna break.

60
00:04:08,248 --> 00:04:09,290
I see.

61
00:04:12,461 --> 00:04:16,547
That's why it's nearly impossible
to stop her.

62
00:04:17,507 --> 00:04:20,927
And that's why
the angels are losing.

63
00:04:23,347 --> 00:04:26,432
That's why we're all gonna die.

64
00:04:34,274 --> 00:04:35,524
Time for your meds, Anna.

65
00:04:39,154 --> 00:04:40,738
Anna?

66
00:04:44,952 --> 00:04:47,036
What's the matter, sweetie?

67
00:04:47,204 --> 00:04:50,081
Your face. What happened
to your face?

68
00:04:50,999 --> 00:04:52,750
I know.

69
00:04:53,877 --> 00:04:55,836
I'm downright kissable.

70
00:04:56,088 --> 00:04:57,338
Shh.

71
00:05:31,248 --> 00:05:35,334
SAM: Come on, one more.
Just give me a chance to win it back.

72
00:05:35,502 --> 00:05:38,087
-lt's your cash.
-Excuse me.

73
00:05:38,255 --> 00:05:40,506
My brother's a little sauced
to be making bets.

74
00:05:40,674 --> 00:05:42,466
Hey, he insisted.

75
00:05:42,634 --> 00:05:44,885
You've already taken, what,
two bills off him?

76
00:05:45,053 --> 00:05:47,471
-l'm just saying.
-Hey, shut up, Dean. l'm fine.

77
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:49,849
No, you're not fine, you're drunk.

78
00:05:50,892 --> 00:05:53,519
-Let's make it 500.
-Five hundred?

79
00:05:54,438 --> 00:05:55,813
Sure.

80
00:05:56,690 --> 00:05:59,275
SAM: Five hundred.
-Your break.

81
00:06:17,753 --> 00:06:19,420
Keep the money.

82
00:06:20,881 --> 00:06:22,548
Keep the money?

83
00:06:22,716 --> 00:06:24,258
But....

84
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:31,557
SAM:
Hey.

85
00:06:31,725 --> 00:06:33,976
Got a lot of nerve
showing up anywhere near me.

86
00:06:34,144 --> 00:06:37,229
-l just have some info and then l'm gone.
-What is it?

87
00:06:37,397 --> 00:06:38,731
I'm hearing a few whispers.

88
00:06:38,899 --> 00:06:41,525
Great. Demon whispers. That's reliable.

89
00:06:41,693 --> 00:06:44,403
A girl named Anna escaped
from a locked ward yesterday.

90
00:06:44,571 --> 00:06:46,906
The demons seem
pretty keen on finding her.

91
00:06:47,074 --> 00:06:49,658
Some heavy hitters turned out
for the Easter egg hunt.

92
00:06:49,826 --> 00:06:51,535
-Why? Who is she?
-No idea.

93
00:06:51,703 --> 00:06:53,704
But l'm thinking that she's important.

94
00:06:53,872 --> 00:06:56,165
Because the order's
to capture her alive.

95
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,085
I just figured that
whatever the deal is...

96
00:06:59,252 --> 00:07:02,088
...you might wanna find this girl
before the demons do.

97
00:07:03,298 --> 00:07:05,841
Look, maybe we should check it out.

98
00:07:06,676 --> 00:07:09,553
-We're working a case, but thanks.
-What case?

99
00:07:09,721 --> 00:07:13,140
-We've got leads, big leads.
-Sounds dangerous.

100
00:07:13,308 --> 00:07:14,934
Ain't goose-chasing some chick...

101
00:07:15,102 --> 00:07:18,854
...who for all we know doesn't exist,
just because you say she's important.

102
00:07:19,022 --> 00:07:21,440
Just delivering the news.
Do what you want with it.

103
00:07:21,608 --> 00:07:24,235
Far as l'm concerned,
I told you, I'm done.

104
00:07:24,402 --> 00:07:26,737
Wait, this hospital Anna
escaped from.

105
00:07:27,489 --> 00:07:29,323
Got a name?

106
00:07:32,744 --> 00:07:35,538
Can l get a copy
of the Missing Persons report?

107
00:07:36,623 --> 00:07:38,499
Great. Okay. Thanks.

108
00:07:39,543 --> 00:07:43,712
-Well, Anna Milton's definitely real.
-Don't mean the case is real.

109
00:07:44,172 --> 00:07:47,925
-This hospital's a three-day drive.
-We've driven further for less, Dean.

110
00:07:51,138 --> 00:07:54,140
-You got something to say, say it.
-l'm saying it. This sucks.

111
00:07:55,725 --> 00:07:57,601
You're not pissed we're after the girl.

112
00:07:57,769 --> 00:07:59,937
-You're pissed Ruby threw us the tip.
-Right.

113
00:08:00,105 --> 00:08:02,481
Far as you're concerned,
the hell bitch is family.

114
00:08:02,649 --> 00:08:05,526
Something major must have
happened while l was downstairs...

115
00:08:05,694 --> 00:08:08,154
...because I come back
and you're BFF with a demon.

116
00:08:08,321 --> 00:08:10,447
I told you.
She helped me go after Lilith.

117
00:08:10,615 --> 00:08:13,117
Well, thanks for the thumbnail.
Real vivid.

118
00:08:13,285 --> 00:08:15,119
You wanna fill in a little detail?

119
00:08:15,287 --> 00:08:17,496
Sure, Dean, let's trade stories.

120
00:08:17,664 --> 00:08:19,999
You first. How was hell?
Don't spare the details.

121
00:09:11,176 --> 00:09:13,636
Come on!

122
00:09:13,803 --> 00:09:16,347
Where the hell are you?!

123
00:09:18,183 --> 00:09:20,267
MAN: l was wondering whether
to come or not.

124
00:09:20,435 --> 00:09:22,978
I mean, you shot one
of my coworkers.

125
00:09:26,441 --> 00:09:28,192
Don't take this
the wrong way, Sam...

126
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,110
...but you don't look so hot, buddy.

127
00:09:32,572 --> 00:09:35,241
Guess burying your brother
didn't agree with you.

128
00:09:42,791 --> 00:09:44,166
Well?

129
00:09:44,334 --> 00:09:46,877
Let's see that special little knife
of yours first.

130
00:09:54,719 --> 00:09:56,011
No Devil's Traps either.

131
00:09:57,889 --> 00:09:59,848
I'm not here to play games.

132
00:10:02,227 --> 00:10:04,603
Well, let me guess.

133
00:10:05,438 --> 00:10:06,855
You wanna make a deal.

134
00:10:09,567 --> 00:10:14,196
And round and round
the Winchesters go.

135
00:10:15,657 --> 00:10:17,491
Sorry, Sam. That's not gonna happen.

136
00:10:27,210 --> 00:10:30,004
I don't want ten years.
I don't want one year.

137
00:10:30,171 --> 00:10:33,632
I don't want candy.
I want to trade places with Dean.

138
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:35,217
No.

139
00:10:35,385 --> 00:10:37,803
Just take me! lt's a fair trade!

140
00:10:37,971 --> 00:10:39,263
No.

141
00:10:41,933 --> 00:10:43,517
Why not?

142
00:10:43,768 --> 00:10:47,229
Lilith wants me dead.
Just let Dean go and she can have me.

143
00:10:47,397 --> 00:10:50,649
Don't you understand, Sam?
It's not about your soul.

144
00:10:51,234 --> 00:10:53,110
Dean's in hell,
right where we want him.

145
00:10:53,278 --> 00:10:56,280
We've got everything exactly
the way we want it.

146
00:10:56,448 --> 00:10:58,449
You wanna kill me, go ahead.

147
00:10:58,616 --> 00:11:00,826
I've made peace with my lord.

148
00:11:19,304 --> 00:11:21,472
WOMAN: Of course,
I wanna help however I can.

149
00:11:21,639 --> 00:11:24,224
SAM: The orderly has no recollection
of Anna's escape?

150
00:11:24,392 --> 00:11:26,435
Apparently, she knocked
him unconscious.

151
00:11:26,603 --> 00:11:28,145
The blow caused some amnesia.

152
00:11:28,313 --> 00:11:30,481
He doesn't even remember
coming into her room.

153
00:11:30,648 --> 00:11:33,734
Hell of a right hook to knock out
a guy with 80 pounds on her.

154
00:11:33,902 --> 00:11:35,986
We think she may have planned this.

155
00:11:36,154 --> 00:11:38,655
-Waited behind the door.
-Right.

156
00:11:38,823 --> 00:11:41,450
You mentioned
Anna's illness was recent.

157
00:11:41,618 --> 00:11:44,453
Two months ago
she was happy, well-adjusted.

158
00:11:44,621 --> 00:11:47,247
Journalism major,
lots of friends, bright future.

159
00:11:47,415 --> 00:11:49,416
So, what happened?
She just flipped?

160
00:11:50,293 --> 00:11:52,336
Well, that's the tragedy
of schizophrenia.

161
00:11:52,504 --> 00:11:54,963
Within weeks,
Anna was overtaken by delusions.

162
00:11:55,507 --> 00:11:57,549
What kind of delusions?

163
00:11:57,717 --> 00:11:59,635
She thought
demons were everywhere.

164
00:12:01,262 --> 00:12:02,388
Interesting.

165
00:12:03,723 --> 00:12:07,059
WOMAN: lt's not uncommon for our
patients to believe that monsters are real.

166
00:12:08,395 --> 00:12:10,729
Well, that's just batty.

167
00:12:25,829 --> 00:12:27,538
It's Revelations.

168
00:12:27,705 --> 00:12:30,916
Since when does the Book of
Revelations have jack-o-lanterns?

169
00:12:31,084 --> 00:12:33,502
It's a little-known translation.

170
00:12:35,088 --> 00:12:37,589
Well, Anna's father
was a church deacon.

171
00:12:37,757 --> 00:12:41,385
When she became ill, her paranoia
took on religious overtones.

172
00:12:41,553 --> 00:12:46,473
She was convinced the devil was about
to rise up and end the world.

173
00:12:46,891 --> 00:12:48,434
I hope you find her.

174
00:12:48,601 --> 00:12:51,979
It's dangerous for her
to be out there alone right now.

175
00:13:07,328 --> 00:13:08,829
Maybe they're not home.

176
00:13:08,997 --> 00:13:10,289
Both cars in the driveway.

177
00:13:23,470 --> 00:13:25,345
Mr. and Mrs. Milton?

178
00:13:26,347 --> 00:13:28,891
SAM:
We're from the sheriff's department.

179
00:13:29,767 --> 00:13:32,728
Just wanted to ask you
a couple of questions.

180
00:13:52,999 --> 00:13:54,416
[SNlFFS]

181
00:13:56,044 --> 00:13:57,836
Sulfur.

182
00:13:58,421 --> 00:14:00,756
Demons beat us here.

183
00:14:00,924 --> 00:14:02,508
Whatever the deal is with Anna--

184
00:14:02,675 --> 00:14:05,802
Yeah, they want her.
And they're not screwing around.

185
00:14:06,346 --> 00:14:11,391
All right, so, l'm Girl, Interrupted
and l know the score of the Apocalypse.

186
00:14:11,559 --> 00:14:13,227
Just busted out of the nut box.

187
00:14:14,187 --> 00:14:16,939
Possibly using superpowers,
by the way.

188
00:14:17,232 --> 00:14:19,441
Where do l go?

189
00:14:21,236 --> 00:14:23,612
Hey, you got those sketches
from Anna's notebook?

190
00:14:23,821 --> 00:14:25,781
-Yeah.
-Let me see them.

191
00:14:27,534 --> 00:14:29,326
Check this out.

192
00:14:35,041 --> 00:14:38,710
She was drawing the window
of her church, over and over.

193
00:14:39,420 --> 00:14:41,129
If you were religious, scared...

194
00:14:41,339 --> 00:14:44,758
...and had demons on your ass,
where would you go to feel safe?

195
00:15:14,664 --> 00:15:16,331
Dean.

196
00:15:22,922 --> 00:15:24,423
Anna?

197
00:15:26,384 --> 00:15:28,802
We're not gonna hurt you.

198
00:15:28,970 --> 00:15:30,137
We're here to help.

199
00:15:31,681 --> 00:15:34,600
My name is Sam.
This is my brother, Dean.

200
00:15:34,767 --> 00:15:36,018
ANNA:
Sam?

201
00:15:36,686 --> 00:15:38,687
Not Sam Winchester?

202
00:15:41,149 --> 00:15:42,190
Yeah.

203
00:15:46,279 --> 00:15:47,487
And you're Dean?

204
00:15:49,532 --> 00:15:50,699
The Dean?

205
00:15:51,951 --> 00:15:54,119
Well, yeah.

206
00:15:54,287 --> 00:15:56,705
The Dean, I guess.

207
00:15:56,914 --> 00:15:58,540
It's really you.

208
00:15:59,626 --> 00:16:01,710
Oh, my God.

209
00:16:01,919 --> 00:16:03,462
The angels talk about you.

210
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:06,882
You were in hell,
but Castiel pulled you out...

211
00:16:07,050 --> 00:16:09,384
...and some of them
think you can help save us.

212
00:16:10,887 --> 00:16:13,889
And some of them
don't like you at all.

213
00:16:14,057 --> 00:16:16,308
They talk about you
all the time lately.

214
00:16:16,476 --> 00:16:18,393
I feel like I know you.

215
00:16:19,228 --> 00:16:20,729
So you talk to angels?

216
00:16:21,439 --> 00:16:23,357
Oh, no, no. No way.

217
00:16:23,524 --> 00:16:27,903
They probably don't even know l exist.
I just kind of overhear them.

218
00:16:28,071 --> 00:16:29,154
You overhear them?

219
00:16:29,322 --> 00:16:33,367
Yeah, they talk
and sometimes l just...

220
00:16:33,534 --> 00:16:35,369
...hear them in my head.

221
00:16:36,496 --> 00:16:38,497
Like right now?

222
00:16:38,665 --> 00:16:40,540
Not right this second. But a lot.

223
00:16:40,708 --> 00:16:43,543
And l can't shut them out.
There are so many of them.

224
00:16:44,253 --> 00:16:46,546
They lock you up with
a case of the crazies...

225
00:16:46,714 --> 00:16:50,509
...when really you were
just tuning in to angel radio?

226
00:16:52,762 --> 00:16:54,012
Yes.

227
00:16:54,180 --> 00:16:55,597
Thank you.

228
00:16:56,099 --> 00:16:58,600
Anna, when did the voices start?
Do you remember?

229
00:16:58,768 --> 00:17:01,436
I can tell you exactly.
September 1 8th.

230
00:17:04,107 --> 00:17:06,108
Day l got out of hell.

231
00:17:06,275 --> 00:17:09,069
First words l heard, clear as a bell:

232
00:17:09,612 --> 00:17:11,988
"Dean Winchester is saved."

233
00:17:15,410 --> 00:17:16,785
What do you think?

234
00:17:16,953 --> 00:17:19,121
This is above my paygrade, man.

235
00:17:20,456 --> 00:17:23,250
Well, at least now we know why
the demons want you so bad.

236
00:17:24,001 --> 00:17:27,796
They get ahold of you and they can hear
everything the other side's cooking.

237
00:17:28,005 --> 00:17:29,631
You're 1-900-ANGEL.

238
00:17:33,052 --> 00:17:36,430
Hey, do you know,
are my parents okay?

239
00:17:36,597 --> 00:17:39,808
I didn't go home. l was afraid.

240
00:17:39,976 --> 00:17:41,601
You got the girl? Good, let's go.

241
00:17:41,769 --> 00:17:43,770
-Her face!
-lt's okay. She's here to help.

242
00:17:43,938 --> 00:17:45,647
-Don't be so sure.
-We have to hurry.

243
00:17:45,815 --> 00:17:47,983
-Why?
-Because a demon's coming. Big-timer.

244
00:17:48,151 --> 00:17:49,985
-We can fight later, Dean.
-Convenient.

245
00:17:50,153 --> 00:17:53,488
Showing up right when we find the girl
with some bigwig on your tail.

246
00:17:53,656 --> 00:17:54,990
RUBY:
I didn't bring him. You did.

247
00:17:55,158 --> 00:17:57,159
DEAN: What?
-He followed from the girl's house.

248
00:17:57,326 --> 00:17:58,952
-We gotta go now.
-Dean.

249
00:18:03,124 --> 00:18:04,958
It's too late.

250
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:06,918
He's here.

251
